# Generated artefacts: screenshots, filmstrips and the recorded showcase.
# `npm run shots` / `strip` / `film` rebuild all of it, so none of it belongs in
# history — except the one GIF both READMEs embed, which has to be in the repo
# for the image to resolve on GitHub. Git will not descend into an ignored
# directory, so the exception needs the directory re-opened a level at a time.
artifacts/*
!artifacts/shots/
artifacts/shots/*
!artifacts/shots/showcase.gif
